{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261126/photo/bkn-20261126152205230-1126_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261126160249\"/><p>電訊商SmarTone(數碼通)用戶手機信號突然中斷，有用戶手機顯示「沒有服務」。Downdetector網站顯示，SmarTone於今日(26日)下午2時30分開始，錄得過千戶用戶報告事故。SmarTone在社交專頁發文致歉，指留意到部分地區的網絡服務出現不穩定情況，現正積極調查及跟進，並會盡力減低對客戶的影響。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T08:23:24.356304+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":166,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T07:22:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T12:37:17.708628+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T08:16:48.570272+00:00","content_hash":"dccf6b38a0ed9eacc0eb1728fc50f0d4081c37b4cbed930c2214bcabc82e7194","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}